{"4125200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brewgether", "steam_appid": 4125200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍺 <strong>Brew. Sell. Expand. Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong><i><u>Brewgether</u></i></strong> is a co-op brewery management sim where you and your friends build a brewing empire from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br>Start with a small countryside setup, master the art of brewing, supply bars and roadside stands, hire employees,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   buy property, and grow into an industry-scale operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Every drink you craft, every bar you run, and every house you rent out brings you one step closer to becoming the region's top supplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/3406a5121ba14ac2a407bf94aab38038.poster.avif?t=1784213926\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/3406a5121ba14ac2a407bf94aab38038.webm?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/3406a5121ba14ac2a407bf94aab38038.mp4?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍶 <strong>Master the Art of Brewing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Brew beer, wine, and spirits across multiple hands-on stations — grind grain, stomp grapes, boil wort, distill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  spirits, and age your product in barrels. Each station has its own interactive minigame that rewards skill with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  faster processing and bonus yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong><i>Add up to 3 catalysts per drink to create thousands of unique combinations. Discover hidden legendary</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>  recipes for massive price bonuses and bragging rights.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/b7d022f01ed341a998bb02f1b339315e.poster.avif?t=1784213926\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/b7d022f01ed341a998bb02f1b339315e.webm?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/b7d022f01ed341a998bb02f1b339315e.mp4?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍻 <strong>Run Bars &amp; Roadside Stands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Stock your bar shelves and open the doors. Customers have preferred drink selections, keep the atmosphere — lighting, music, cleanliness, and temperature all matter. Keep the place running smoothly and <strong><i>watch bar brawls break out among your less sober patrons</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/2191dac0607139659cf791fca6671b4d.poster.avif?t=1784213926\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/2191dac0607139659cf791fca6671b4d.webm?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/2191dac0607139659cf791fca6671b4d.mp4?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👷 <strong>Hire &amp; Manage Employees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  You can't do it all alone —  Hire brewery workers  operate stations, bottle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  drinks, and apply catalysts. Pay their wages on time, and watch them develop mastery that unlocks speed and yield bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Remember to pay them.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/a423f685b426450e760aa1db55ac5ad4.poster.avif?t=1784213926\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/a423f685b426450e760aa1db55ac5ad4.webm?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/a423f685b426450e760aa1db55ac5ad4.mp4?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏡 <strong>Buy Land, Build Houses, Collect Rent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Expand beyond brewing. Purchase land, build houses, and furnish them with beds, couches, tables, lamps, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each piece of furniture placed correctly increases the rent you can charge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Assign tenants, collect rent from your postal box, and build a property portfolio that generates passive income</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  while you focus on brewing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>More people in town, means more alcohol selling!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/8484289c5b79f56efe244787114a23ce.poster.avif?t=1784213926\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/8484289c5b79f56efe244787114a23ce.webm?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/8484289c5b79f56efe244787114a23ce.mp4?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 <strong>Built for Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Play solo or with up to 4 players. Every system — brewing, selling, hiring, building — works seamlessly in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  multiplayer. Split tasks across your crew: one player brews while another runs the bar, a third manages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  properties, and a fourth handles the logistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop-in friendly with Steam integration, shared economies, and late-join support and cloud saves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/a7cbae69fe02dc2729b0e790e6f64513.poster.avif?t=1784213926\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/a7cbae69fe02dc2729b0e790e6f64513.webm?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/a7cbae69fe02dc2729b0e790e6f64513.mp4?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📈 <strong>Grow Your Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new locations, progress through a skill tree across multiple skills — boost station output, upgrade employees, assign unlockable perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock trade discounts with townsfolk merchants. Upgrade your stand and bar to sell more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Drink for Buffs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Drink your own product for temporary buffs — movement speed, jump height, station speed bonuses, build time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  reduction, shop discounts and more.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍺 <strong>Brew. Sell. Expand. Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong><i><u>Brewgether</u></i></strong> is a co-op brewery management sim where you and your friends build a brewing empire from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br>Start with a small countryside setup, master the art of brewing, supply bars and roadside stands, hire employees,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   buy property, and grow into an industry-scale operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Every drink you craft, every bar you run, and every house you rent out brings you one step closer to becoming the region's top supplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/3406a5121ba14ac2a407bf94aab38038.poster.avif?t=1784213926\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/3406a5121ba14ac2a407bf94aab38038.webm?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125200/extras/3406a5121ba14ac2a407bf94aab38038.mp4?t=1784213926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍶 <strong>Master the Art of Brewing</strong></h2><p clas